1
00:00:00,271 --> 00:00:01,511
(Raj:)Yeah, you didn't have
to buy groceries

2
00:00:01,639 --> 00:00:02,679
because you were breast-feeding.

3
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:07,350
(Bernadette:)So I guess if it weren't for me,

4
00:00:07,478 --> 00:00:08,648
(Bernadette:)you'd still be living with her, huh?

5
00:00:08,779 --> 00:00:10,659
(Howard:)Not exactly.

6
00:00:10,781 --> 00:00:11,851
(Penny:)What do you mean, not exactly?

7
00:00:12,016 --> 00:00:14,826
(Howard:)Well, things would be
a little different.

8
00:00:15,286 --> 00:00:19,856
Howard, where is my lunch? I'm starving!

9
00:00:21,425 --> 00:00:24,535
(Howard:)I know you're starving.
The neighbors know you're starving.

10
00:00:24,662 --> 00:00:27,662
(Howard:)There's starving people in Africa
who know you're starving!

11
00:00:29,833 --> 00:00:32,373
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)That's it?
There's not enough food!

12
00:00:32,536 --> 00:00:36,216
Well, you cleaned out Earth!
I don't know what else to do!

13
00:00:38,208 --> 00:00:39,988
(Bernadette:)How is this any different?

14
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,890
(Howard:)You didn't let me finish.

15
00:00:42,546 --> 00:00:44,386
(Howard:)Here you go, Mother.

16
00:00:45,049 --> 00:00:47,459
You're a good boy, Howard!

17
00:00:47,551 --> 00:00:51,401
Such a good boy!

18
00:00:56,193 --> 00:01:01,023
Walt, did she die
or did you kill her?

